<section class="mb-16">
  <div class="material-shell p-8 md:p-10">
    <div class="material-grid text-center">
      <h2 class="mb-6 text-3xl font-bold text-slate-950">My Journey to Neuropsychology</h2>
      <figure class="relative px-6 py-4 md:px-10">
        <div class="absolute left-6 top-2 text-5xl text-[#d94c7d]/20">"</div>
        <blockquote class="mx-auto max-w-4xl text-xl italic leading-relaxed text-gray-800">
          <p class="mb-4">
            I became a neuropsychologist because, like many others out there, I had a loved one who suffered a brain injury due to medical complications
            and later experienced significant developmental delays.
          </p>
          <p>
            After watching my family members struggle endlessly to find a single person who could bring all the information together and help our family
            find a path forward, I decided to dedicate myself to becoming that person.
          </p>
        </blockquote>
        <div class="absolute bottom-2 right-6 text-5xl text-[#176b5b]/20">"</div>
      </figure>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
